    tag: "BULLET \xB7 FLY"
    description: Bullets fall in an arc. +25% damage.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1ad3665f9c481b4cb29d20ac78bf7da, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 9
    title: WAVE
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 FLY"
    description: Bullets wiggle up and down as they fly.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 870e377516ffb7f4da6375232288aff7, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 10
    title: BOOMERANG
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 FLY"
    description: Bullets fly back to you and can hit on the way.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e8a5313d3453ec47a15b4ca81f39a09, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 11
    title: LONG SHOT
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 FLY"
    description: +6% damage per unit flown, up to 2x.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0e12832e58e50f3489308c8b40081a7d, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 12
    title: DRILL
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 FLY"
    description: Bullets go through one wall. -20% damage.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 99e55686d2b811f459d0b8704dba2d98, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 13
    title: EXPLOSIVE
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Bullets explode on every hit (6 damage around). -25% fire rate.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 51b085a320a7f764583c7a6f35497a70, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 14
    title: HAMMER
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits, blasts and pulls knock enemies 2.5x harder.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5a58ffa71dbe02489c99fabbd29847d, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 15
    title: FORK
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: On the first enemy, bullets split in 2 (35% damage each).
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b593c1d27d5cddb40b2d7aad4807d997, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 16
    title: CHAIN
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits zap 2 nearby enemies for 40% damage.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ac2a8f83a18ec4246b7fb106f055c1df, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 17
    title: CHILL
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hit enemies move and attack at half speed for 1.5s.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ed4cadbb64aeeab489ae1aa638907bc5, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 18
    title: IGNITE
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: 'Hit enemies burn: 5 damage every 0.5s for 2s.'
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 350230875722f21499e612e71ed81dd1, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 19
    title: VORTEX
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits pull nearby enemies toward the hit.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1f5c5abe2e19d74a9fd078d84381e34, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 20
    title: REAPER
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits kill enemies at 15% health or less.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 03ff728ec01349e41af8a3d6854a3269, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 21
    title: SHRAPNEL
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 END"
    description: Bullets burst into 3 shards when they stop (30% damage each).
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 80ef69c1e693b6f4f96c57cc190d684e, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 22
    title: MINE
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 END"
    description: Bullets stopping on walls may leave a mine (15 damage blast).
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b66e9789834be84418ec25db6030f40f, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 23
    title: GROUND POUND
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: Hard landings throw nearby enemies up (20 damage).
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9de5e47fb1199554b9746dfbffeaab48, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 24
    title: EXTRA JUMP
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: One more jump in the air.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7bab3bca3536ae74abddd19a63453671, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 25
    title: DASH
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: 'Shift: dash sideways. Can''t be hurt while dashing.'
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 49596c10611cea54faf3634022fadd1e, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 26
    title: THICK SKIN
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: +40 max health.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8ab8fa25d739a3740a22838eb1859781, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 27
    title: EXTRA LIFE
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: Once per run, come back after dying.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e4f168e551e65f4499040f69ad92bb7d, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 28
    title: REGENERATION
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 PLAYER"
    description: Heal 2 HP per second after 3s without getting hurt.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 462430940ce6d6d4d86c40be6a927c54, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 29
    title: HOT BARREL
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 GUN"
    description: Keep firing to shoot faster, up to 1.6x.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 06941e8897aa4f148bcd139b6a1993d1, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 30
    title: STEADY AIM
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 GUN"
    description: 'Shots go almost straight: 80% less spread.'
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e06ddfcf585b92c4594396980a795e91, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 31
    title: AIR GUNNER
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 GUN"
    description: +35% damage while in the air.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1a74af40d75042f4d8ac859398839ecc, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 32
    title: ADRENALINE
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 GUN"
    description: Below 35% health, fire 1.5x faster.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 11df5dc03678cb14ca00173ee91d6e70, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 33
    title: OPENER
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 GUN"
    description: The first shot after a 0.5s pause deals 3x damage.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9879dde66021d34eb50f3644d7d5cc9, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 34
    title: VOID FEAST
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 ENEMY"
    description: Enemies falling into the void heal you 10 HP.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d80bdaf9ebbb2174c9c21bde7858b073, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 35
    title: DEATH BLAST
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 ENEMY"
    description: Killed enemies explode for 20 damage around them.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 804c9633c209781479baaac76a4aa582, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 36
    title: CRASH
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 ENEMY"
    description: Enemies knocked into walls or each other take 12 damage.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 366416eaeb99e074b8ff0ff626724a9b, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
  - type: 37
    title: VAMPIRE
    tag: "SINGLE \xB7 ENEMY"
    description: Every kill heals you 3 HP.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 20c221f3e0cbaac46ac6a41f93ccb850, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 0
